 Vow. Each booster contains 15 Magic: The Gathering cards and 1 traditional foil double-sided token, with a total of 5 Rare and/or Mythic Rare cards, and a total of 8 cards with stunning special treatments—including Showcase, Borderless, and Extended-Art cards. The best boosters to open just for fun— each Innistrad: Crimson Vow Set Booster contains 12 Magic cards, 1 Art Card, and 1 token, ad card, Helper card, or special card from Magic's history (a card from \"The List\"), with a combination of 1–4 Rares and/or Mythic Rares, 2–7 Uncommons, 3–8 Commons, and 1 Land card in every pack."}]},{"productId":281719,"name":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow - Collector Booster Omega Pack","cleanName":"Innistrad Crimson Vow Collector Booster Omega Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/281719_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2862,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/281719/magic-innistrad-crimson-vow-innistrad-crimson-vow-collector-booster-omega-pack","modifiedOn":"2025-08-06T13:44:59.1","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"YOUR BLACK-TIE BOOSTER\r\n<br><br>These Innistrad: Crimson Vow boosters are dressed up for the occasion. They contain everything you need to impress at a vampire wedding, including traditional foils, extended-art cards, showcase cards, and a combination of 5 Rares or Mythics. And no bloodsucker's ball complete without an appearance from the prince of darkness himself-each booster contains one Dracula series card!\r\n<br><br>Contains 16 cards in English."},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166162171"}]}]}